  "details": "Description\n\nI use handtracking since my controllers broke, i'm experiencing double clicking while using text. for example: if i press ''Y\" i'd get \"YY\" and backspacing removes both letters.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nIt might be a software problem or something with the meta handtracking. but it effects my playing time\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Performance\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: Quest (platform: Android - Quest, store: Oculus, headset: Oculus Quest 2)\n\nrawPlatform: Android\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.2-1901-4a7d603ee0-Release\n\nunityVersion: 2022.3.22f2-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-09-01_20-42-48.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_01fbe285-b111-40ef-b8f0-7f5f8fed36f8/1/file)",
